  "body": "This popped up in the log for t2bot.io. Unknown cause and unknown impact. Synapse 0.31.2\r\n```\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"/home/matrix/.synapse/local/lib/python2.7/site-packages/twisted/internet/defer.py\", line 150, in maybeDeferred\r\n    result = f(*args, **kw)\r\n  File \"/home/matrix/.synapse/local/lib/python2.7/site-packages/synapse/federation/send_queue.py\", line 109, in _clear_queue\r\n    self._clear_queue_before_pos(position_to_delete)\r\n  File \"/home/matrix/.synapse/local/lib/python2.7/site-packages/synapse/federation/send_queue.py\", line 122, in _clear_queue_before_pos\r\n    for uids in itervalues(self.presence_changed)\r\n  File \"/home/matrix/.synapse/local/lib/python2.7/site-packages/six.py\", line 602, in itervalues\r\n    return d.itervalues(**kw)\r\n  File \"/home/matrix/.synapse/local/lib/python2.7/site-packages/sortedcontainers/sorteddict.py\", line 370, in method\r\n    raise AttributeError(message)\r\nAttributeError: SortedDict.itervalues() is not implemented. Use SortedDict.values() instead.\r\n```",
